<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Tenders and grants that fit your firm' }) %>
<section class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Self-hosted tender monitoring</p>
  <h1>Every tender worth bidding for, found and ranked before your competitors open their inbox.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Bid Finder watches Find a Tender, Contracts Finder, Public Contracts Scotland, Sell2Wales, TED, SAM.gov, the UK grant funders and the private portals you have accounts on. It scores every notice against your firm and tells you why it fits.</p>
  <p class="row">
    <% if (canRegister) { %><a class="button" href="/register"><%= hosted ? 'Create your account' : 'Set up this server' %></a><% } %>
    <a class="button <%= canRegister ? 'ghost' : '' %>" href="/login">Sign in</a>
  </p>
  <% if (stats.open) { %><p class="muted"><%= stats.open.toLocaleString('en-GB') %> open opportunities tracked across <%= sources %> sources right now.</p><% } %>
</section>
<section class="features">
  <div><h2>One ranked feed</h2><p>Keywords, CPV categories, contract value, region and deadline become a fit score out of 100, with the reasons spelled out.</p></div>
  <div><h2>Alerts where you work</h2><p>Saved searches send new matches to email, Slack or a webhook as they appear, or as a daily or weekly round-up.</p></div>
  <div><h2>From notice to bid</h2><p>Shortlist, take notes with your team and track each bid from qualifying through to won or lost.</p></div>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
